      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "YkFYX",
          "name": "s1hdr",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 12,
          "alignItems": "center",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "gvGYQ",
              "name": "s1label",
              "fill": "#B8860B",
              "content": "Session 1",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 75,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "letterSpacing": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zB6cE",
              "name": "s1title",
              "fill": "#2C2420",
              "content": "The Heart of Worship",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
              "fontSize": 100,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "fontStyle": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Jxwwg",
          "name": "sec1",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 22,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "vJnk5",
              "name": "sec1t",
              "fill": "#2C2420",
              "content": "1. The Heart and Importance of Worship",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 75,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "uILjq",
              "name": "sec1b1",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 30,
              "padding": [
                0,
                0,
                0,
                16
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "yFgBk",
                  "name": "sec1p1",
                  "fill": "#2C2420",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Worship is the center of the Christian life.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 75,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rlRol",
                  "name": "sec1p2",
                  "fill": "#6B5D52",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Everything in this world will pass away, but one thing we do now\nand will keep doing in heaven is worshiping God.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 75,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "JuEsC",
                  "name": "sec1p3",
                  "fill": "#6B5D52",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Worship is not merely a church activity.\nIt is the reason we were created,\nand true worship is a relationship with God, not a ritual.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 75,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "bUnwL",
                  "name": "sec1p4",
                  "fill": "#6B5D52",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "God alone is worthy of worship, because He is our Creator, our Father, the One who gives us life and breath. Believers must not worship anything else or any other god, but must offer worship to God alone.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 75,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "xXSS0",
          "name": "quote1",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#F5F1EB",
          "stroke": {
            "thickness": {
              "left": 3
            },
            "fill": "#B8860B"
          },
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
          "padding": [
            16,
            24
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "5C7QA",
              "name": "quote1t",
              "fill": "#2C2420",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "True worship is\n\"worship in spirit and truth\"",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 75,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "SZQJ4",
              "name": "quote1r",
              "fill": "#B8860B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "width": 1730,
              "height": 83,
              "content": "- John 4:23",
              "textAlign": "right",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 75,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "fontStyle": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "NJSXY",
          "name": "sec1_cont",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 30,
          "padding": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            16
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "flGB4",
              "name": "sec1p5",
              "fill": "#6B5D52",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The worship that pleases God\ncomes from a genuine heart, not from duty or ritual,\nbut from love, reverence, and the truth that\nGod alone is the true God.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 75,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "lxHsj",
              "name": "sec1p6",
              "fill": "#6B5D52",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "For He seeks those who worship Him \"in spirit and truth\" (John 4:23).",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 75,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TaaYj",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 3400,
          "name": "l6",
          "fill": "#6B5D52",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 2480,
          "content": "6",
          "textAlign": "center",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 42,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
