    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "OkITQ",
      "x": 33540,
      "y": 5000,
      "name": "c4",
      "width": 2480,
      "height": 3508,
      "fill": "#FFFFFF",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 48,
      "padding": [
        236,
        260,
        354,
        236
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "p8XLm",
          "name": "hdr2",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 12,
          "alignItems": "center",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "FRmmu",
              "name": "lab2",
              "fill": "#B8860B",
              "content": "Session 2",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 75,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "letterSpacing": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "htakR",
              "name": "ttl2",
              "fill": "#2C2420",
              "content": "Principles of Worship Leading (4)",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
              "fontSize": 100,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "fontStyle": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "1IWss",
          "name": "body2",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 30,
          "padding": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            16
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "oV6RK",
              "name": "s33t",
              "fill": "#2C2420",
              "content": "3.3 Good Preparation Gives Worship Direction",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 75,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "srZ7A",
              "name": "s33p",
              "fill": "#6B5D52",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Good worship leading does not happen by accident. It comes through preparation.\nA worship leader should:",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 75,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ADRGC",
              "name": "s33l",
              "fill": "#6B5D52",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "•  Pray for God's guidance\n•  Choose songs with one clear direction\n•  Arrange the song order\n•  Plan each segment\n•  Coordinate with the preacher and related teams\n•  Prepare speaking points and Scripture",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 75,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "NRjLS",
              "name": "noteWrap",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "padding": [
                40,
                0,
                0,
                0
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ODCCq",
                  "name": "s33note",
                  "fill": "#888888",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "In general, worship often begins with songs of praise\nand then gradually moves into deeper worship.\nEach song carries different content and emphasis.\nWe should understand what kind of song fits each part of worship,\nfor example praise, celebration, worship, exaltation, surrender,\nresponse, challenge, and so on.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 75,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "fontStyle": "italic"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "j3iqo",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 890,
          "y": 3200,
          "name": "separator",
          "width": 700,
          "gap": 16,
          "justifyContent": "center",
          "alignItems": "center",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "cornerRadius": 1,
